<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> Tale</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong>Drama/Emotional, Action</p>
<p><strong>Page Layout (Optional):</strong> N/A</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> Gal joins a CIA task force to retrieve anom artifacts and ends up over her head. It will focus on the relationships between her team, and her relationships with her powers.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> A newly transferred Jordan is attached to an anomaly recovery team and sent out to retrieve a fountain<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-812479-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-812479-1')">1</a></sup> held in a remote camp in the forest. After getting to know each other on the way there, including an old friend of hers, Jessie. After dispatching a few guards (these guards are MC&amp;D Mercs) outside the perimeter, they get ambushed by void things, tearing her squad to shreds, to Jordan's horror. She tries to save Jessie by rewinding time around her wound. She's able to, but ends sacrificing herself for Jessie. She wakes up in a dark chamber, and Death walks in to meet her.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The &quot;new&quot; gal (Jordan) is an anomaly herself, able to rewind time at extremely local areas. Her team doesn't know, and she doesn't know the full extent of what she can do until now.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> This is gonna be the first of a series (taking suggestions for names) Also Voidthings is a placeholder for another name</p>
